jobs.content:
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Years from now, history will look back at this moment as a landmark for the human race—the moment when generative AI began to change&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;everything&lt;/em&gt;. Luckily, you happen to be living through it. Now what?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re one of those rare people driven to add their intellectual energy to the relentless momentum of technological advancement, consider Loka your optimal leverage point.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Loka, a globally distributed tech consultancy based in Silicon Valley, is seeking an Advanced Backend Engineer to join our growing team. In this position you’ll serve as the primary specialist in designing and implementing Backend solutions across multiple projects. Your expertise in Python and/or NodeJs development will help us design and deliver high-performing, reliable and secure backend applications. Ultimately we expect you to not just fit in with our Backend crew but to elevate it to new heights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We count more than 100 certified specialists, technical experts and PhDs among our teammates, all of whom contribute their brilliance to serving our clients as well as to mentoring junior colleagues. We work entirely remotely, test new ideas with an in-house incubator called LokaLabs, observe local holidays and take every other Friday off (really). We’re as proud of our culture as we are of our projects. You will be too.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop and implement Backend components spanning APIs, serverless functions, distributed services, queue systems, data storage services and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to decisions around architectural trade-offs on a system, as well as application level with performance requirements and external constraints in mind.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to and implement security and data-protection best practices across systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the quality bar by maintaining effective test suites and writing clean code and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work together with your technical leads and clients to gather requirements, align expectations and provide updates on deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow Loka’s career track for growth by demonstrating technical excellence, innovation, autonomy, ownership, communication and teamwork.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct report to a Backend Lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up to date with industry trends to incorporate cutting-edge techniques and tools into projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in cross-functional collaboration with other teams (Machine Learning, Data Engineering, etc.) to ensure seamless integration of Backend solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take full responsibility for assigned tasks and projects, ensuring accountability for outcomes and results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Hard Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years Backend development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in Python or NodeJs (Typescript)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong CS foundation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of API/Web communication protocols (openapi, grpc, etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand concurrency concepts in APIs/Web&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand cloud services and landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand traditional and serverless architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capable of working container-first&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Not Required but Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Languages: Go, Typescript, PHP, Ruby&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frameworks: Django, FastAPI, NextJS, Express, Laravel, RoR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databases: PostgreSQL, DynamoDB, MySQL, Redis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with and building CI/CD pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with DevOps tools (AWS CDK, cdktf or terraform)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with generative AI tools and services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with observability tools and stacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent English: As a global team we work entirely in English for meetings, customer calls and business communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CV written in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personality Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious: You strive to learn and grow into different industries with a modern tech stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomous: We’re a fully remote, globally distributed team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative: You work well as a team player.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable: You operate with a startup mindset and move at a startup pace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Every other Friday off (26 extra days off a year)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote and flexible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore and Relocation programs (three months work abroad or full international relo)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid sick days and local holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business English classes program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous Learning Support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fitness&amp;nbsp;and/or Mental Health Subscriptions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to LokaLabs™, our internal research and development program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defined career path&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your achievements matter to us! Be sure your CV, LinkedIn and GitHub profiles are up to date, written in English and accurately reflect your experience.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;At Loka our teams launch meaningful projects across a wide range of industries. In the last year we helped advance the world&#39;s #1 AI reading tutor, transform rundown homes into green machines and accelerate novel drug discovery to fight leukemia. And we did it all while working 100% remotely and enjoying every other Friday off 😎&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re seeking an experienced Alliances professional from inside the AWS ecosystem to own how Loka works with AWS day to day. As AWS Innovation Partner of the Year, our name is already known across AWS startup, SMB and healthcare teams. You&#39;ll walk in with credibility, with relationships and processes already in place, and with real ownership to shape alliances as you see fit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your time will split roughly evenly between AWS-facing and internal work. Externally, you&#39;ll build relationships with AWS District Managers and the PDM team. Internally, you&#39;ll make sure our sales leaders have the AWS relationships, data and insights they need to win. Your AWS alliances experience matters more than your knowledge of AI partner programs. The former is what you&#39;ll need to hit the ground running; the latter you&#39;ll learn with us as our Anthropic and OpenAI practices grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, individual contributor role. Alliance&#39;s roles are rarely black and white, so a self-starter who takes the ball and runs will thrive here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the growth of Loka&#39;s AWS partnership, ensuring alignment with our sales priorities and AWS partner frameworks, including our Strategic Collaboration Agreement (SCA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the business owner of alliances. Where ownership isn&#39;t clear-cut, define roles and responsibilities with Sales and other teams, and shape existing processes as the partnership evolves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own partner metrics and reporting: build systematic tracking of AWS Partner KPIs (including AO/PO) and internal metrics across segments, and turn them into forecasts and insights for sales leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run regular cadences with the AWS partner team and internal stakeholders to track progress and deliver business reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and grow relationships with AWS field teams, including District Managers across startup and SMB, and drive consistent engagement with prioritized teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales, Marketing and Operations on joint go-to-market initiatives that accelerate pipeline growth and new opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Operations on deal registration and alliance compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Loka at AWS partner events, District offsites and industry conferences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the growth of our relationships with AI partners such as Anthropic and OpenAI, including program milestones, certifications and events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track AWS ecosystem developments and market trends, and proactively identify and act on growth opportunities without waiting for direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MUST HAVE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in alliances, partner or channel roles within the AWS ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on knowledge of how AWS partner teams work: partnering with PDMs, running reports out of ACE, and co-sell and AO/PO motions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, with experience building metrics, reporting and forecasts that leadership relies on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity and high autonomy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel for District offsites and AWS events up to 50% of the month&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligible to work in the US without sponsorship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;STRONGLY PREFERRED&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience at a professional services or cloud consulting company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing relationships with AWS PDMs or District Managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of AWS partner programs and funding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to Anthropic (Claude) or OpenAI partner programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AWS certifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary range $160,000–$190,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Every other Friday off, i.e. 26 extra days off a year. Our team calls it a life-changing benefit. We think you&#39;ll agree.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% remote. Work where you feel most comfortable and productive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, dental and vision coverage, life insurance and disability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401k with up to 4% employer matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LokaLabs™: Apply moonshot technologies to overlooked societal challenges in our internal incubator.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous Learning Support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid vacation days, sick days and local holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please submit your CV in English.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration:&lt;/strong&gt; Six months&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Format:&lt;/strong&gt; Full time (40 hrs/week), paid&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the last year at Loka, our teams launched almost 200 GenAI projects for companies of all kinds, including the world’s Number 1 GenAI reading tutor, a startup that transforms homes into batteries and a leading cancer-fighting laboratory. And we did it all while enjoying every other Friday off 😎&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Data - Machine Learning Intern, you&#39;ll gain professional experience supporting Loka’s certified specialists, technical experts and PhDs while elevating your skillset, building a portfolio and launching projects you’re proud of.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in designing, developing and maintaining data pipelines to ensure clean, reliable and timely data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the team to implement and optimize ETL processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate data from various sources into warehouses, data lakes and lakehouses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support data management tasks, including data cleaning, validation and transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand business objectives and develop models that help achieve them, plus metrics to track their progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement ML systems using classical ML, DL and Foundation Models following best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in client communications by helping gather requirements and communicate deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore and visualize data with a careful eye for issues that require data cleaning as well as differences in data distribution that may affect performance after deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and analyze model errors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Hard Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Last year of a bachelor’s degree in Computer Science or related&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of Python, ML, and Data libraries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of Databases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of statistical, ML and deep learning algorithms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience visualizing and manipulating big datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: AWS knowledge, (Py)Spark, Airflow, Data Lakes and Data Warehouses&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Soft Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity: You’re ambitious to learn and grow in different industries utilizing a modern tech stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomy and positivity: We’re a fully remote, globally distributed team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teamwork: Enjoy a collaborative approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptability: Operate with a startup mindset and move at a startup pace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dependable: You can be trusted to deliver high-quality work.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Every other Friday off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote and flexible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid sick days and local holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please submit your CV in English.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the last year at Loka, our remote team of DevOps Engineers helped bring free Lyfts to patients in transportation deserts, deliver the world’s first smart implantable for cancer care, eliminate $1 billion in food waste, launch 6 projects in LokaLabs™ (our own incubator), accelerate 3 startups to acquisition, move 1 scrappy startup to unicorn status, and still enjoyed every other Friday off (yes, we really take the day off).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are using modern technologies to support an incredible variety of meaningful projects, while proving work/life balance isn’t a catchphrase, it’s our culture. Join our team, feed your need to grow, and ship projects you believe in with a team you’re proud to be a part of.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working on an internal project using the following tools: Git, CI/CD pipelines, Docker, Kubernetes, AWS and IaC (Infrastructure as a code)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and understanding the basic DevOps principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of DevOps technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Git&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Docker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ci/CD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Linux&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Networking Basics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DNS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HTTP/HTTPS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Firewalls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree in Computer Science or a related discipline or a recent graduate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ambition to learn and grow into different industries with a modern tech stack across multiple products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomy, adaptability and positivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in teams and communicate effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem-solving attitude and curiosity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in English and Macedonian&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Your achievements matter to us! Ensure your CV and LinkedIn and GitHub profiles are up to date and accurately reflect your experience.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Loka&lt;/strong&gt; we use a modern tech stack to support meaningful projects across a huge range of industries. In the last year our teams have helped clients advance the world&#39;s #1 AI reading tutor, eliminate $1B in food waste and develop novel drugs for fighting cancer, all while enjoying every other Friday off. Join us, feed your need to grow and ship projects you believe in with a team you&#39;re proud to be a part of.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re seeking a &lt;strong&gt;DevOps Lead&lt;/strong&gt; to deploy, secure and maintain robust applications in production environments, mainly AWS. The ideal candidate will not only apply their technical brilliance but also take a leadership role in contributing positively to Loka&#39;s unique culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and design cloud infrastructure (mainly AWS), leading projects from architecture through to implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead high-complexity projects with high-priority clients, independently resolve critical technical issues and introduce innovative solutions that ensure long-term maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape technical strategies, anticipate future trends, align initiatives with key business outcomes and drive execution across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;May be brought into existing projects to resolve technical challenges or manage difficult client situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, onboard and develop talent - nurturing individual strengths, supporting career growth and creating the next generation of leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish psychological safety, proactively monitor team engagement and independently mediate conflicts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead regular one-on-ones, drive structured performance reviews and implement improvement plans where needed, including managing complex performance cases independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively mentor senior engineers and manage teams, establishing best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess change implementation options, evaluate benefits and risks, and recommend the most appropriate approach with minimal oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track key KPIs and align team workflows with broader strategic objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively lead high-pressure client engagements and ensure smooth cross-functional collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of DevOps experience, including 3+ years leading a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with serverless compute, scripting, AWS, Docker and Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong command of GitOps, CI/CD tooling and infrastructure-as-code (AWS CDK / Terraform / CDKTF).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NodeJS, TypeScript, Python and database administration are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Soft Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building high-performing, inclusive teams and developing talent at all levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence managing budgets, KPIs and cross-functional stakeholder relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong client interaction skills and the ability to lead high-pressure engagements calmly and effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomy, adaptability and a consistently positive presence on the teams you lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent English - we work entirely in English for meetings, client calls and business communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CV written in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Personality Profile&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious:&lt;/strong&gt; Ambition to learn and grow into different industries with a modern tech stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomous and positive:&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re a fully remote, globally distributed team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team player:&lt;/strong&gt; Enjoy a collaborative approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptable:&lt;/strong&gt; Operate with a startup mindset and move at a startup pace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empathetic:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead with compassion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Every other Friday off (26 extra days off a year)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote-first culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore and Relocation programs (three months work abroad or full international relo)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid sick days and local holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business English classes program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous Learning Support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fitness and/or Mental Health Subscriptions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to LokaLabs™, our internal research and development program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defined career path&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your achievements matter to us! Ensure your CV, LinkedIn and GitHub profiles are up to date and accurately reflect your experience.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;At Loka, our teams have helped clients advance the world&#39;s #1 AI reading tutor, eliminate $1B in food waste and develop novel drugs for fighting cancer. To cap it off, at the end of 2024 Loka was recognized by AWS as Innovation Partner of the Year, outshining 150,000 partners for the title. And we did it all while working remotely and enjoying every other Friday off 😎.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be the operational backbone of HX Ops in Western Europe: reliable, compliant and impact-aware, executing the standards the HX Ops team sets, and owning the judgment calls day to day. You&#39;ll be one of the first points of contact for HX requests in the region, balancing urgency, employee impact, risk and cost while keeping Loka&#39;s global HX Ops standards and local legal realities in sync. This is a role for someone who wants real end-to-end ownership, not a queue to work through in order. This is a hybrid role, requiring 2 days per week in our Portugal office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end HX Operations for Western Europe: onboarding, offboarding, contracts, local legal compliance, payroll coordination, benefits administration and vendor relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as one of the first points of contact for HX requests in the region, triaging and resolving based on urgency, employee impact, risk and cost, escalating complex or high-risk cases to the HX Operations Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate payroll inputs, expenses and benefits administration with Finance and local providers, with full accountability for accuracy and deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage raises, promotions and other salary-related administrative processes with precision and confidentiality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the Lisbon office day to day, from space, supplies, and equipment logistics to vendor relationships and invoicing, while shaping a welcoming culture and environment that makes it a place people want to be.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own vendor and contract relationships for your region, including benefits providers, local vendors and other regional suppliers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure local legal and compliance accuracy while aligning with Loka&#39;s global HX Ops standards, flagging where local requirements need to override global consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify process gaps, bottlenecks and manual work in your region, and propose and help build fixes such as documentation, workflow changes and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support internal programs and employee experience initiatives in your region as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Must-Haves&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
