&lt;p&gt;Years from now, history will look back at this moment as a landmark for the human race—the moment when generative AI began to change&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;everything&lt;/em&gt;. Luckily, you happen to be living through it. Now what?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re one of those rare people driven to add their intellectual energy to the relentless momentum of technological advancement, consider Loka your optimal leverage point.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Loka, a globally distributed tech consultancy based in Silicon Valley, is looking for a Junior Backend Engineer to grow with our team. You’ll work side by side with experienced engineers on real client projects, helping design and build backend applications that are fast, reliable and secure. If you have a foundation in Python and/or Node.js and you’re eager to learn, you’ll get hands-on experience across a variety of projects, with mentors who care about helping you level up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We count more than 100 certified specialists, technical experts and PhDs among our teammates, all of whom contribute their brilliance to serving our clients as well as to mentoring junior colleagues. We work entirely remotely, test new ideas with an in-house incubator called LokaLabs, observe local holidays and take every other Friday off (really). We’re as proud of our culture as we are of our projects. You will be too.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build backend components like APIs, serverless functions, queue systems, and data storage services, with guidance from senior engineers as you learn the ropes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join design discussions to learn how architectural decisions get made, asking questions and sharing ideas as your understanding grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pick up security and data-protection best practices and apply them in your day-to-day work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, well-tested code and clear documentation, with code reviews that help you sharpen your skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join conversations with technical leads and clients to see how requirements are gathered and projects are delivered, and share updates on your own work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow along Loka&#39;s career track, with clear expectations and support as you build your skills, independence, and confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report to a Backend Lead who will mentor you and support your development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore new tools and techniques, with room to experiment and bring fresh ideas to the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with teams across Machine Learning, Data Engineering, and more, getting exposure to how different parts of a system fit together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of your tasks and see them through, knowing your team has your back when you need help.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Hard Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 to 2 years of backend development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Python or Node.js (TypeScript).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid computer science foundation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of API/Web communication protocols (OpenAPI, gRPC, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand concurrency concepts in APIs/Web.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capable of working container-first.&lt;/li&gt;
