&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;We count more than 100 certified specialists, technical experts and PhDs among our teammates, committed Lokals who bring their brilliance both to client work and to mentoring junior colleagues. We work entirely remotely, test new ideas in our in-house incubator LokaLabs™, observe local holidays and take every other Friday off (really).&lt;/p&gt;
