&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in technical project management in software development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client-facing project experience in a consultancy or startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grasp of Agile methodologies and project tools (e.g., JIRA, Notion)&lt;/li&gt;
